@startuml
title Bobby Jenkins - proposed request flow

actor "Client" as Client
participant "FastAPI API boundary" as API
participant "Application logic" as Logic

Client -> API : HTTP request (endpoint to be defined)
API -> API : Validate request against schema
alt Invalid request input
  API --> Client : 422 validation error (FastAPI default)
else Valid request input
  API -> Logic : Execute agreed workflow
  Logic --> API : Successful result
  API --> Client : Success response (contract to be defined)
end

note over API, Logic
  Logical responsibilities within one application.
  Domain errors, access control, and operational
  failures need contracts before implementation.
end note
@enduml
